[[0,2703099,0,1,0,1,"2018-09-04T08:29:35","killer7","",[],"","Prominent Pro-Patent Judge Issues Opinion Declaring All Software Patents Bad","https://www.techdirt.com/articles/20161005/15280135720/prominent-pro-patent-judge-issues-opinion-declaring-all-software-patents-bad.shtml","law"],[1,13713807,0,0,0,0,"2018-09-04T09:29:00","1Iron_Curtain","",[],"<p>So essentially opening up the door for China and any Third World entity, especially in the Islamic world to start rewiring our software programs and then selling them back to us with all kinds of faulty security systems and which will it make it easier to hack us. </p>\n<p>But then again you can't have lack of &quot;diversity&quot; in software patents according to the liberal logic, because its just is not good for &quot;progress&quot; in that sector of the economy.</p>"]]